Package: plotphotos
Type: Package
Title: Sort Plot Photos and Stamp Capture Dates
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Josef", "Brůna", email = "josef.bruna@ibot.cas.cz", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Copies files from one or more input folders into plot-based categories,
    using JPEG GPS metadata, filename prefixes, or parent folder names. Files without
    usable coordinates or a plot match are retained, and category folders are created
    only when needed. A separate function resizes JPEG copies using Lanczos
    resampling and writes capture dates with configurable size and JPEG quality,
    while preserving the input folder structure, applying EXIF orientation, and
    retaining original files. Output naming avoids overwriting existing files.
